concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 Commencement"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Sections 1, 2, 4 and 6, Division 1 of Part IV and sections 28 and 70 shall come into operation on the day on which this Act receives the Royal Assent. (2) The remaining provisions of this Act shall come into operation on a date to be fixed by Proclamation." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Sections 1, 2, 4 and 6, Division 1 of Part IV and sections 28 and 70 shall come into operation on the day on which this Act receives the Royal Assent. (2) The remaining provisions of this Act shall come into operation on a date to be fixed by Proclamation."@en ;
