concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-3a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3A Overview of Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3a ;
    values:originalText "Constitution of the Australian Federal Police (1) Division 1 of Part II of this Act provides that the Australian Federal Police consists of a Commissioner of Police, one or more Deputy Commissioners of Police, AFP employees, special members and special protective service officers. Commissioner and Deputy Commissioners (2) The Commissioner and Deputy Commissioners are appointed by the Governor-General. Division 1 of Part III sets out matters dealing with such appointments." ;
    skos:definition "Constitution of the Australian Federal Police (1) Division 1 of Part II of this Act provides that the Australian Federal Police consists of a Commissioner of Police, one or more Deputy Commissioners of Police, AFP employees, special members and special protective service officers. Commissioner and Deputy Commissioners (2) The Commissioner and Deputy Commissioners are appointed by the Governor-General. Division 1 of Part III sets out matters dealing with such appointments."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "83df721eebfe61146126f387af402b21040d01a219c29e817eb7d0fcb3c72f24" ;
    cof:pageNumber "13"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-3a-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-3a-ss-2 ;
