doc:sec-12 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "12 Immunities from certain State and Territory laws" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The Commissioner, a Deputy Commissioner or an AFP employee is not required under, or by reason of, a law of a State or Territory: (a) to obtain or have a licence or permission for doing any act or thing in the exercise of his or her powers or the performance of his or her duties as the Commissioner, a Deputy Commissioner or an AFP employee; or (b) to register any vehicle, vessel, animal or article belonging to the Commonwealth." ;
