concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-17-ss-3a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "17(3A) Commissioner and Deputy Commissioners"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-17-ss-3a ;
    values:originalText "(3A) Where a person is re-appointed under this section for a term beginning immediately after the end of the person’s last appointment, the person’s service is to be taken to be continuous." ;
