    cof:title "20(1) Remuneration and allowances" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Commissioner shall be paid such remuneration as is determined by the Remuneration Tribunal, but if no determination of that remuneration is in operation, he or she shall be paid such remuneration as is prescribed." ;
