concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-21 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "21 Leave of absence"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-21 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Commissioner has such recreation leave entitlements as are determined by the Remuneration Tribunal.   Commissioner, Deputy Commissioners and AFP employees etc.  Part III Commissioner and Deputy Commissioners  Division 1 Section 22 Australian Federal Police Act 1979 Compilation date: 08/11/2025 (1A) The Minister may grant the Commissioner leave of absence, other than recreation leave, on such terms and conditions as to remuneration or otherwise as the Minister determines. (2) The Commissioner may grant leave of absence to a Deputy Commissioner on such terms and conditions as to remuneration or otherwise as the Commissioner determines." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Commissioner has such recreation leave entitlements as are determined by the Remuneration Tribunal.   Commissioner, Deputy Commissioners and AFP employees etc.  Part III Commissioner and Deputy Commissioners  Division 1 Section 22 Australian Federal Police Act 1979 Compilation date: 08/11/2025 (1A) The Minister may grant the Commissioner leave of absence, other than recreation leave, on such terms and conditions as to remuneration or otherwise as the Minister determines. (2) The Commissioner may grant leave of absence to a Deputy Commissioner on such terms and conditions as to remuneration or otherwise as the Commissioner determines."@en ;
