concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-28 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "28 Termination of employment by Commissioner"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-28 ;
    values:originalText "The Commissioner may at any time, by notice in writing, terminate the employment of an AFP employee. Note: The Fair Work Act 2009 has rules that apply to termination of employment. Subdivision D—Resignation and retirement" ;
    skos:definition "The Commissioner may at any time, by notice in writing, terminate the employment of an AFP employee. Note: The Fair Work Act 2009 has rules that apply to termination of employment. Subdivision D—Resignation and retirement"@en ;
