doc:sec-32-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "32(4) Retirement on invalidity grounds" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) In spite of this section, an AFP employee who: (a) is an eligible employee for the purposes of the Superannuation Act 1976; and (b) has not reached his or her maximum retiring age (within the meaning of that Act); is not capable of being retired on the ground of invalidity (within the meaning of Part IVA of that Act) unless CSC has given a certificate under section 54C of that Act. AFP employee is a member of the superannuation scheme under the Superannuation Act 1990" ;
    cof:pageNumber "64"^^xsd:integer .

