concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-33-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "33(4) Time when retirement on invalidity grounds takes effect"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-33-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The regulations may make provision in relation to the review of decisions of the Commissioner to retire AFP employees under subsection 32(1), where the employees have not consented to being retired under that subsection, including: (a) the period within which, and the manner in which, AFP employees may apply for review of such decisions; and (b) the powers available to a person or body conducting such a review; and (c) if the regulations make provision for a person or body conducting such a review to make recommendations to the Commissioner—the Commissioner giving effect to such recommendations by confirming or revoking such decisions." ;
    skos:definition "(4) The regulations may make provision in relation to the review of decisions of the Commissioner to retire AFP employees under subsection 32(1), where the employees have not consented to being retired under that subsection, including: (a) the period within which, and the manner in which, AFP employees may apply for review of such decisions; and (b) the powers available to a person or body conducting such a review; and (c) if the regulations make provision for a person or body conducting such a review to make recommendations to the Commissioner—the Commissioner giving effect to such recommendations by confirming or revoking such decisions."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "43298c0427fe6191687f6e63fb17094c91da3cd79ee264e5a57dea530265f4f7" ;
    values:partOf concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-33 ;
    cof:pageNumber "66"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Regulations must provide for review of decisions to retire AFP employees under subsection 32(1) without consent." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf> ;
    dc:source "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.66" ;
    cml:asserts concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-33-ss-4-norm .
