concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40e a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40E Special members"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-40e ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Commissioner may, on such terms and conditions as he or she determines in writing, appoint a person as a special member of the Australian Federal Police to assist in the performance of its functions. Note: The Commissioner may, under section 35A, authorise special payments to special members. (2) A person appointed under subsection (1) has, during the continuance of his or her appointment: (a) any powers and duties that are expressly conferred or imposed on special members under a provision of this Act or of any other Act; and (b) such of the powers and duties conferred or imposed on members as are specified in his or her instrument of appointment.   Commissioner’s command powers etc.  Part IV Conferral of status of protective service officer  Division 3A Section 40EA Australian Federal Police Act 1979 Compilation date: 08/11/2025" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Commissioner may, on such terms and conditions as he or she determines in writing, appoint a person as a special member of the Australian Federal Police to assist in the performance of its functions. Note: The Commissioner may, under section 35A, authorise special payments to special members. (2) A person appointed under subsection (1) has, during the continuance of his or her appointment: (a) any powers and duties that are expressly conferred or imposed on special members under a provision of this Act or of any other Act; and (b) such of the powers and duties conferred or imposed on members as are specified in his or her instrument of appointment.   Commissioner’s command powers etc.  Part IV Conferral of status of protective service officer  Division 3A Section 40EA Australian Federal Police Act 1979 Compilation date: 08/11/2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "892884cf56d33c8ea241737857c0873798559ddc69d3b4f2f499c8e6f35c704b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "78"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40e-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40e-ss-2 ;
