doc:sec-40l-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "40L(2) Financial statements" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The statement must: (a) be made in a form and manner required by the Commissioner; and (b) contain any information required by the Commissioner about the financial affairs of the person during a period, or each period, specified by the Commissioner; and (c) be accompanied by any documents required by the Commissioner. Time limit for giving statement" ;
    cof:pageNumber "87"^^xsd:integer .

