doc:sec-40m-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "40M(1) Prescribed persons may require AFP appointees to undergo" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person authorised to do so under the regulations may give an AFP appointee who is on duty a written direction requiring him or her to do one or more of the following: (aa) undergo an alcohol screening test; (a) undergo a breath test; (b) provide a body sample of a kind specified in the direction for a prohibited drug test; in accordance with the regulations. Providing blood sample if breath test indicates the presence of alcohol" ;
