concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40ra a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40RA Object of this Part"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-40ra ;
    values:originalText "The object of this Part is to establish the procedures by which: (a) AFP conduct issues and AFP practices issues; and (b) other issues related to the Australian Federal Police; may be raised and dealt with." ;
    skos:definition "The object of this Part is to establish the procedures by which: (a) AFP conduct issues and AFP practices issues; and (b) other issues related to the Australian Federal Police; may be raised and dealt with."@en ;
