concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40re a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40RE Head of unit"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-40re ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Commissioner may appoint an AFP appointee, in writing, to be the head of the unit constituted under section 40RD. (2) The head of the unit is responsible for the performance by the unit of its functions. (3) The head of the unit is responsible under subsection (2) directly to: (a) the Commissioner; or (b) if the Commissioner so directs—the Deputy Commissioner, or senior executive AFP employee who is at a level equivalent to that of a Deputy Commissioner, specified in the direction." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Commissioner may appoint an AFP appointee, in writing, to be the head of the unit constituted under section 40RD. (2) The head of the unit is responsible for the performance by the unit of its functions. (3) The head of the unit is responsible under subsection (2) directly to: (a) the Commissioner; or (b) if the Commissioner so directs—the Deputy Commissioner, or senior executive AFP employee who is at a level equivalent to that of a Deputy Commissioner, specified in the direction."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f28cf0e6a03da1e3795b73a51c35b1956a1431f0e7118025c5519e1a9a6b7780" ;
