    skos:prefLabel "40RI(3) AFP practices issues"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-40ri-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of this Act, the practices or procedures of the Australian Federal Police include: (a) the rules, orders and instructions (including the Commissioner’s Orders) in accordance with which AFP appointees are required to perform their duties; and (b) the policies adopted or followed by the Australian Federal Police; and (c) the practices and procedures ordinarily followed by AFP appointees in the performance of their duties." ;
    skos:definition "(3) For the purposes of this Act, the practices or procedures of the Australian Federal Police include: (a) the rules, orders and instructions (including the Commissioner’s Orders) in accordance with which AFP appointees are required to perform their duties; and (b) the policies adopted or followed by the Australian Federal Police; and (c) the practices and procedures ordinarily followed by AFP appointees in the performance of their duties."@en ;
