concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40se a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40SE Recording and dealing with information referred under"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-40se ;
    values:originalText "section 40SD If the Commissioner decides under section 40SD that an AFP conduct issue is to be dealt with under this Part, the Commissioner must: (a) record the details of the information; and (b) deal with the issue in accordance with the Commissioner’s orders issued for the purposes of subsection 40TA(1).   Professional standards and AFP conduct and practices issues  Part V Dealing with AFP conduct or practices issues  Division 3 Section 40TA Australian Federal Police Act 1979 Compilation date: 08/11/2025" ;
    skos:definition "section 40SD If the Commissioner decides under section 40SD that an AFP conduct issue is to be dealt with under this Part, the Commissioner must: (a) record the details of the information; and (b) deal with the issue in accordance with the Commissioner’s orders issued for the purposes of subsection 40TA(1).   Professional standards and AFP conduct and practices issues  Part V Dealing with AFP conduct or practices issues  Division 3 Section 40TA Australian Federal Police Act 1979 Compilation date: 08/11/2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a93e5cb7e39abfc9b071241eb0bd89e930d6da51974ff93af41f0e1307151451" ;
    cof:pageNumber "110"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Commissioner must record and deal with an AFP conduct issue in accordance with orders." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
