    cof:title "40TA(3) Commissioner’s orders about how AFP conduct or practices" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) Without limiting subsection (1), the Commissioner must, so far as practicable, ensure that the complainant (if any) in relation to an AFP practices issue: (a) is kept informed, as frequently as is reasonable, and to the extent that is reasonable, in the circumstances, of progress in dealing with the AFP practices issue; and (b) is advised of any action taken in relation to the AFP practices issue." ;
