concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40tf a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40TF Discretion to take no further action in relation to AFP conduct"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-40tf ;
    values:originalText "or practices issue (1) This section applies if: (a) a person gives information under section 40SA that raises: (i) an AFP conduct issue in relation to conduct engaged in by an AFP appointee; or (ii) an AFP practices issue in relation to a practice or procedure of the AFP; or (b) the Commissioner decides under section 40SD that an AFP conduct issue in relation to an AFP appointee is to be dealt with under this Part. (2) The Commissioner may determine that no further action is to be taken under this Part in relation to the issue if the Commissioner is satisfied that: (a) the person became aware of the conduct, or the practice or procedure, more than 12 months before the person gave the information under section 40SA; or (b) appropriate action has already been taken: (i) against the AFP appointee in relation to the conduct; or (ii) in relation to the practice or procedure; or" ;
    skos:definition "or practices issue (1) This section applies if: (a) a person gives information under section 40SA that raises: (i) an AFP conduct issue in relation to conduct engaged in by an AFP appointee; or (ii) an AFP practices issue in relation to a practice or procedure of the AFP; or (b) the Commissioner decides under section 40SD that an AFP conduct issue in relation to an AFP appointee is to be dealt with under this Part. (2) The Commissioner may determine that no further action is to be taken under this Part in relation to the issue if the Commissioner is satisfied that: (a) the person became aware of the conduct, or the practice or procedure, more than 12 months before the person gave the information under section 40SA; or (b) appropriate action has already been taken: (i) against the AFP appointee in relation to the conduct; or (ii) in relation to the practice or procedure; or"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b14473a63b9a0f0430b241b99c6718cd8470193056f0a97bf19865c5c376237b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "115"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40tf-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40tf-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf> ;
    dc:source "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.115" .
