concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40tm a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40TM Head of unit constituted under section 40RD to notify"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-40tm ;
    values:originalText "Ombudsman of category 3 conduct issues (1) The head of the unit constituted under section 40RD must notify the Ombudsman of the issue if the issue is a category 3 conduct issue. (2) Subsection (1) does not apply if this Subdivision applies to the issue because of subsection 40TL(4) (Ombudsman arranging for issue to be dealt with jointly by Ombudsman and Australian Federal Police)." ;
    skos:definition "Ombudsman of category 3 conduct issues (1) The head of the unit constituted under section 40RD must notify the Ombudsman of the issue if the issue is a category 3 conduct issue. (2) Subsection (1) does not apply if this Subdivision applies to the issue because of subsection 40TL(4) (Ombudsman arranging for issue to be dealt with jointly by Ombudsman and Australian Federal Police)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8a5f2e33c7ec7ada237bd89d79469d49743f87eb608acdf4596aa7cca007a0e4" ;
    cof:pageNumber "120"^^xsd:integer ;
