doc:sec-40tn-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "40TN(3) Head of unit constituted under section 40RD generally" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The head of the unit may allocate the issue to a person who is not a member of the unit only with the Commissioner’s agreement.   Professional standards and AFP conduct and practices issues  Part V Dealing with AFP conduct or practices issues  Division 3 Section 40TO Australian Federal Police Act 1979 Compilation date: 08/11/2025" ;
