doc:sec-40tq-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "40TQ(2) How category 3 conduct issue or corruption issue is dealt with" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) In investigating the issue, the investigator must: (a) ensure that: (i) the AFP appointee; and (ii) the complainant (if any); have, subject to the requirements of the investigation, an adequate opportunity to be heard in relation to the issue; and (b) consider whether the information: (i) given under section 40SA in relation to the issue; or (ii) obtained in the course of dealing with the issue; raises an AFP practices issue." ;
