concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40tv a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40TV Taking action on report"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-40tv ;
    values:originalText "The Commissioner must ensure that: (a) any recommendations made in the report under section 40TU are fully considered; and (b) appropriate action is taken in relation to the issue to which the report relates." ;
    skos:definition "The Commissioner must ensure that: (a) any recommendations made in the report under section 40TU are fully considered; and (b) appropriate action is taken in relation to the issue to which the report relates."@en ;
