concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40tx a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40TX Commissioner to ensure that appropriate action is taken in"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-40tx ;
    values:originalText "relation to AFP practices issue (1) This section applies if: (a) a person gives information under section 40SA that raises an AFP practices issue; or (b) an AFP practices issue is: (i) brought, under section 40TK, to the attention of an AFP appointee; or (ii) identified, under section 40TW, in a report prepared under section 40TU; as a result of an AFP conduct issue being dealt with under this Part. (2) The Commissioner must ensure that appropriate action is taken to have the issue dealt with." ;
    skos:definition "relation to AFP practices issue (1) This section applies if: (a) a person gives information under section 40SA that raises an AFP practices issue; or (b) an AFP practices issue is: (i) brought, under section 40TK, to the attention of an AFP appointee; or (ii) identified, under section 40TW, in a report prepared under section 40TU; as a result of an AFP conduct issue being dealt with under this Part. (2) The Commissioner must ensure that appropriate action is taken to have the issue dealt with."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b2a44ed0bdd10a302b82efc12d2c9d527f17be19cfa7f2028cf8731d7f09947c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "125"^^xsd:integer ;
