concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40ud a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40UD Reports of special inquiries"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-40ud ;
    values:originalText "(1) If an inquiry is held in accordance with arrangements made under section 40UA, the person holding the inquiry: (a) must report to the Minister the results of the inquiry; and (b) may make such recommendations (if any) arising out of the inquiry as the person considers appropriate. (2) On receipt of a report of the results of an inquiry held in accordance with arrangements made under section 40UA, the" ;
    skos:definition "(1) If an inquiry is held in accordance with arrangements made under section 40UA, the person holding the inquiry: (a) must report to the Minister the results of the inquiry; and (b) may make such recommendations (if any) arising out of the inquiry as the person considers appropriate. (2) On receipt of a report of the results of an inquiry held in accordance with arrangements made under section 40UA, the"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "388ec728e0e76b75c22412c5f5943cfb1299ee432b2d16b8930539ea504c3ee9" ;
    cof:pageNumber "127"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40ud-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40ud-ss-2 ;
