concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-40vd a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40VD Relationship with other laws"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-40vd ;
    values:originalText "(1) Sections 40VB and 40VC do not authorise an AFP appointee to contravene, or fail to comply with, a law that would, if those sections had not been enacted, apply in relation to the investigation or inquiry. (2) Nothing in subsection (1) affects the operation of any other provision of this Division.   Professional standards and AFP conduct and practices issues  Part V Investigative powers  Division 5 Section 40VE Australian Federal Police Act 1979 Compilation date: 08/11/2025" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Sections 40VB and 40VC do not authorise an AFP appointee to contravene, or fail to comply with, a law that would, if those sections had not been enacted, apply in relation to the investigation or inquiry. (2) Nothing in subsection (1) affects the operation of any other provision of this Division.   Professional standards and AFP conduct and practices issues  Part V Investigative powers  Division 5 Section 40VE Australian Federal Police Act 1979 Compilation date: 08/11/2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f8f3fc2919af03d6d6f5ae8e51313e1847b224d573cde9761759624cd83ed071" ;
    cof:pageNumber "130"^^xsd:integer ;
