    values:originalText "(1) This section applies to a person (other than an AFP appointee or the Ombudsman) who conducts: (a) an investigation of a category 3 conduct issue or a corruption issue under Subdivision D of Division 3; or (b) an inquiry under Division 4. Note 1: AFP appointees are covered by the confidentiality requirements of section 60A. Note 2: The Ombudsman is covered by the confidentiality requirements of section 35 of the Ombudsman Act 1976." ;
