concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-43-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "43(3) Notice of charge etc."@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-43-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Where the Commissioner notifies the Minister administering the Crimes (Superannuation Benefits) Act 1989 that a person has been charged with an offence, the Commissioner shall notify that Minister in writing if: (a) the person is acquitted or convicted of the offence; or (b) the charge is withdrawn or otherwise disposed of without the conviction of the person." ;
    skos:definition "(3) Where the Commissioner notifies the Minister administering the Crimes (Superannuation Benefits) Act 1989 that a person has been charged with an offence, the Commissioner shall notify that Minister in writing if: (a) the person is acquitted or convicted of the offence; or (b) the charge is withdrawn or otherwise disposed of without the conviction of the person."@en ;
