concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-49ea-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "49EA(3) Extension of certain restraining orders"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-49ea-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The DPP must give written notice of an application under subsection (1) for the extension of a restraining order to: (a) the owner of the property against which the restraining order was made; and (b) any other person who the DPP has reason to believe may have an interest in the property." ;
    skos:definition "(3) The DPP must give written notice of an application under subsection (1) for the extension of a restraining order to: (a) the owner of the property against which the restraining order was made; and (b) any other person who the DPP has reason to believe may have an interest in the property."@en ;
