    cof:pageNumber "170"^^xsd:integer .

concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-49h a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "49H Notice of restraining orders"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-49h ;
    values:originalText "(1) Subject to subsection (2), where a restraining order is made against a person’s property, the DPP must give the person written notice of the order. (2) Where: (a) a court makes a restraining order; and (b) the court is satisfied that it would be in the public interest to delay giving notice of the order to a person; the court may include in the restraining order an order that giving the person notice of the restraining order be delayed for the specified period and the DPP must give the person notice of the restraining order as soon as practicable after the end of the specified period.   Loss of certain superannuation rights and benefits  Part VA Restraining orders  Division 3A Section 49J Australian Federal Police Act 1979 Compilation date: 08/11/2025" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Subject to subsection (2), where a restraining order is made against a person’s property, the DPP must give the person written notice of the order. (2) Where: (a) a court makes a restraining order; and (b) the court is satisfied that it would be in the public interest to delay giving notice of the order to a person; the court may include in the restraining order an order that giving the person notice of the restraining order be delayed for the specified period and the DPP must give the person notice of the restraining order as soon as practicable after the end of the specified period.   Loss of certain superannuation rights and benefits  Part VA Restraining orders  Division 3A Section 49J Australian Federal Police Act 1979 Compilation date: 08/11/2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2aafc096ea6d6eb1155fabb19d08516d9ca6e981e3512386c2962636dfb5e3cd" ;
    cof:pageNumber "170"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-49h-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-federal-police-act-1979-sec-49h-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf> ;
    dc:source "australian-federal-police-act-1979.pdf, p.170" .
